  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Association of Legal Aid Against Sexual Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The project is implemented in Turkey. The main outcome areas it contributes to are gender equality and democracy and human righst. The main right holders are those who suffer from human rights violations in Turkey, mostly women and LGBTQ-people, actors in the civil society organisations and the government bodies.Through seminars, trainings, organising and mobilising, advocacy and capacity building the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
  </description>
